ed transcripts: all are 5'-truncated (no start ATG, first segment frame mismatch)—annotation of incomplete CDS, as expected. Not a coordinate-system issue. Also, all 2866 complete transcripts match perfectly. Furthermore, all STXBP1 transcripts are fully consistent.\n\nFix the tags bug, re-run, and verify that STXBP1 ENST00000373302.8's MANE_Select is correctly reported. Also fix the report's wording \"all segments consistent\" to reflect reality: \"Of 2998 transcripts, 2866 (those with complete CDS) are fully frame-consistent; the remaining 132 are 5'-truncated CDS annotations (no start codon), whose annotated frames by definition cannot be reconstructed from the truncated start; the coordinate systems match.\"\n\nLet me apply a patch to analysis.py: fix tags parsing + frame_check note + report wording. Then re-run.\n"}}
